[{"id":"hada-2-142-15","words":["verb:hada"],"options":[{"bs":"upućuje","en":"he/it guides"},{"bs":"zaista ćemo ih uputiti","en":"surely we will guide them"},{"bs":"upućuje me","en":"he/it guides me"},{"bs":"uputio me je","en":"he/it guided me"}],"ref":"2:142","answerWord":"يَهْدِى","answerSound":"audio/d8dbdb54fc3544503b72.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"The foolish of the people will say: What hath turned them from the qiblah which they formerly observed? Say: Unto Allah belong the East and the West. He guideth whom He will unto a straight path.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"uputiti","en":"to guide"},"passage":["سَيَقُولُ","ٱلسُّفَهَآءُ","مِنَ","ٱلنَّاسِ","مَا","وَلَّىٰهُمْ","عَن","قِبْلَتِهِمُ","ٱلَّتِى","كَانُوا۟","عَلَيْهَا","قُل","لِّلَّهِ","ٱلْمَشْرِقُ","وَٱلْمَغْرِبُ","يَهْدِى","مَن","يَشَآءُ","إِلَىٰ","صِرَٰطٍ","مُّسْتَقِيمٍ"],"marked":[15],"facts":{"verb":"هَدَى"}},{"id":"hada-7-100-1","words":["verb:hada"],"options":[{"bs":"upućuje","en":"he/it guides"},{"bs":"upućuje ih","en":"he/it guides them"},{"bs":"uputit će me","en":"he/it will guide me"},{"bs":"upućuju","en":"they guide"}],"ref":"7:100","answerWord":"يَهْدِ","answerSound":"audio/70c8be2d550c48644190.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Is it not an indication to those who inherit the land after its people (who thus reaped the consequence of evil-doing) that, if We will, We can smite them for their sins and print upon their hearts so that they hear not?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"uputiti","en":"to guide"},"passage":["أَوَلَمْ","يَهْدِ","لِلَّذِينَ","يَرِثُونَ","ٱلْأَرْضَ","مِنۢ","بَعْدِ","أَهْلِهَآ","أَن","لَّوْ","نَشَآءُ","أَصَبْنَٰهُم","بِذُنُوبِهِمْ","وَنَطْبَعُ","عَلَىٰ","قُلُوبِهِمْ","فَهُمْ","لَا","يَسْمَعُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"هَدَى"}},{"id":"hada-7-181-3","words":["verb:hada"],"options":[{"bs":"upućuju","en":"they guide"},{"bs":"i upućeni su","en":"and they were guided"},{"bs":"uputio me je","en":"he/it guided me"},{"bs":"upućuju nas","en":"they guide us"}],"ref":"7:181","answerWord":"يَهْدُونَ","answerSound":"audio/de6fcc87867efb02be08.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And of those whom We created there is a nation who guide with the Truth and establish justice therewith.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"uputiti","en":"to guide"},"passage":["وَمِمَّنْ","خَلَقْنَآ","أُمَّةٌ","يَهْدُونَ","بِٱلْحَقِّ","وَبِهِۦ","يَعْدِلُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"هَدَى"}},{"id":"hada-10-35-5","words":["verb:hada"],"options":[{"bs":"upućuje","en":"he/it guides"},{"bs":"uputio me je","en":"he/it guided me"},{"bs":"upućuje ih","en":"he/it guides them"},{"bs":"uputio je","en":"he/it guided"}],"ref":"10:35","answerWord":"يَهْدِىٓ","answerSound":"audio/5374afa2393fa22d7b64.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say: Is there of your partners (whom ye ascribe unto Allah) one that leadeth to the Truth? Say: Allah leadeth to the Truth. Is He Who leadeth to the Truth more deserving that He should be followed, or he who findeth not the way unless he (himself) be guided. What aileth you? How judge ye?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"uputiti","en":"to guide"},"passage":["قُلْ","هَلْ","مِن","شُرَكَآئِكُم","مَّن","يَهْدِىٓ","إِلَى","ٱلْحَقِّ","قُلِ","ٱللَّهُ","يَهْدِى","لِلْحَقِّ","أَفَمَن","يَهْدِىٓ","إِلَى","ٱلْحَقِّ","أَحَقُّ","أَن","يُتَّبَعَ","أَمَّن","لَّا","يَهِدِّىٓ","إِلَّآ","أَن","يُهْدَىٰ","فَمَا","لَكُمْ","كَيْفَ","تَحْكُمُونَ"],"marked":[5,13],"facts":{"verb":"هَدَى"}},{"id":"hada-6-84-5","words":["verb:hada"],"options":[{"bs":"uputili smo","en":"we guided"},{"bs":"upućen je","en":"he/it was guided"},{"bs":"upućuje","en":"he/it guides"},{"bs":"i uputio je","en":"and he/it guided"}],"ref":"6:84","answerWord":"هَدَيْنَا","answerSound":"audio/06e2933a3dbcfa1508e1.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And We bestowed upon him Isaac and Jacob; each of them We guided; and Noah did We guide aforetime; and of his seed (We guided) David and Solomon and Job and Joseph and Moses and Aaron. Thus do We reward the good.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"uputiti","en":"to guide"},"passage":["وَوَهَبْنَا","لَهُۥٓ","إِسْحَٰقَ","وَيَعْقُوبَ","كُلًّا","هَدَيْنَا","وَنُوحًا","هَدَيْنَا","مِن","قَبْلُ","وَمِن","ذُرِّيَّتِهِۦ","دَاوُۥدَ","وَسُلَيْمَٰنَ","وَأَيُّوبَ","وَيُوسُفَ","وَمُوسَىٰ","وَهَٰرُونَ","وَكَذَٰلِكَ","نَجْزِى","ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ"],"marked":[5,7],"facts":{"verb":"هَدَى"}},{"id":"hada-7-30-1","words":["verb:hada"],"options":[{"bs":"uputio je","en":"he/it guided"},{"bs":"upućuju nas","en":"they guide us"},{"bs":"upućuje me","en":"he/it guides me"},{"bs":"uputit će ih","en":"He will guide them"}],"ref":"7:30","answerWord":"هَدَىٰ","answerSound":"audio/0fe07f4358ee3fcfa867.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"A party hath He led aright, while error hath just hold over (another) party, for lo! they choose the devils for protecting supporters instead of Allah and deem that they are rightly guided.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"uputiti","en":"to guide"},"passage":["فَرِيقًا","هَدَىٰ","وَفَرِيقًا","حَقَّ","عَلَيْهِمُ","ٱلضَّلَٰلَةُ","إِنَّهُمُ","ٱتَّخَذُوا۟","ٱلشَّيَٰطِينَ","أَوْلِيَآءَ","مِن","دُونِ","ٱللَّهِ","وَيَحْسَبُونَ","أَنَّهُم","مُّهْتَدُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"هَدَى"}},{"id":"hada-13-27-15","words":["verb:hada"],"options":[{"bs":"i upućuje","en":"and he/it guides"},{"bs":"i uputili bismo ih","en":"and We would have guided them"},{"bs":"upućuje me","en":"he/it guides me"},{"bs":"upućuje ih","en":"he/it guides them"}],"ref":"13:27","answerWord":"وَيَهْدِىٓ","answerSound":"audio/b0116db35cf408a7255f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Those who disbelieve say: If only a portent were sent down upon him from his Lord! Say: Lo! Allah sendeth whom He will astray, and guideth unto Himself all who turn (unto Him),","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"uputiti","en":"to guide"},"passage":["وَيَقُولُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","لَوْلَآ","أُنزِلَ","عَلَيْهِ","ءَايَةٌ","مِّن","رَّبِّهِۦ","قُلْ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","يُضِلُّ","مَن","يَشَآءُ","وَيَهْدِىٓ","إِلَيْهِ","مَنْ","أَنَابَ"],"marked":[15],"facts":{"verb":"هَدَى"}},{"id":"hada-26-62-5","words":["verb:hada"],"options":[{"bs":"uputit će me","en":"he/it will guide me"},{"bs":"da ih uputi","en":"so that he/it may guide them"},{"bs":"upućuju","en":"they guide"},{"bs":"pa ih uputite!","en":"so (you all) guide them!"}],"ref":"26:62","answerWord":"سَيَهْدِينِ","answerSound":"audio/16afb4c5456befea479c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: Nay, verily! for lo! my Lord is with me. He will guide me.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"uputiti","en":"to guide"},"passage":["قَالَ","كَلَّآ","إِنَّ","مَعِىَ","رَبِّى","سَيَهْدِينِ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"هَدَى"}},{"id":"hada-4-26-4","words":["verb:hada"],"options":[{"bs":"i upućuje vas","en":"and he/it guides you (all)"},{"bs":"upućuje me","en":"he/it guides me"},{"bs":"upućujete","en":"you (all) guide"},{"bs":"i uputili smo ga","en":"and we guided him"}],"ref":"4:26","answerWord":"وَيَهْدِيَكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/7748086004276f3ddba9.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Allah would explain to you and guide you by the examples of those who were before you, and would turn to you in mercy. Allah is Knower, Wise.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"uputiti","en":"to guide"},"passage":["يُرِيدُ","ٱللَّهُ","لِيُبَيِّنَ","لَكُمْ","وَيَهْدِيَكُمْ","سُنَنَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","مِن","قَبْلِكُمْ","وَيَتُوبَ","عَلَيْكُمْ","وَٱللَّهُ","عَلِيمٌ","حَكِيمٌ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"هَدَى"}},{"id":"hada-4-137-18","words":["verb:hada"],"options":[{"bs":"da ih uputi","en":"so that he/it may guide them"},{"bs":"uputio je","en":"he/it guided"},{"bs":"uputio me je","en":"he/it guided me"},{"bs":"i uputili bismo ih","en":"and We would have guided them"}],"ref":"4:137","answerWord":"لِيَهْدِيَهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/7d519fbb6dd30114089c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! those who believe, then disbelieve and then (again) believe, then disbelieve, and then increase in disbelief, Allah will never pardon them, nor will He guide them unto a way.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"uputiti","en":"to guide"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","ثُمَّ","كَفَرُوا۟","ثُمَّ","ءَامَنُوا۟","ثُمَّ","كَفَرُوا۟","ثُمَّ","ٱزْدَادُوا۟","كُفْرًا","لَّمْ","يَكُنِ","ٱللَّهُ","لِيَغْفِرَ","لَهُمْ","وَلَا","لِيَهْدِيَهُمْ","سَبِيلًۢا"],"marked":[18],"facts":{"verb":"هَدَى"}},{"id":"hada-4-175-11","words":["verb:hada"],"options":[{"bs":"i upućuje ih","en":"and he/it guides them"},{"bs":"i uputi nas!","en":"and guide us!"},{"bs":"i upućuje","en":"and he/it guides"},{"bs":"i upućujem te","en":"and I guide you"}],"ref":"4:175","answerWord":"وَيَهْدِيهِمْ","answerSound":"audio/1ff7ef33c1423eaef1b1.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"As for those who believe in Allah, and hold fast unto Him, them He will cause to enter into His mercy and grace, and will guide them unto Him by a straight road.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"uputiti","en":"to guide"},"passage":["فَأَمَّا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","بِٱللَّهِ","وَٱعْتَصَمُوا۟","بِهِۦ","فَسَيُدْخِلُهُمْ","فِى","رَحْمَةٍ","مِّنْهُ","وَفَضْلٍ","وَيَهْدِيهِمْ","إِلَيْهِ","صِرَٰطًا","مُّسْتَقِيمًا"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"هَدَى"}},{"id":"hada-6-161-2","words":["verb:hada"],"options":[{"bs":"uputio me je","en":"he/it guided me"},{"bs":"upućen je","en":"he/it was guided"},{"bs":"uputio ih je","en":"he/it guided them"},{"bs":"uputi nas","en":"guide us"}],"ref":"6:161","answerWord":"هَدَىٰنِى","answerSound":"audio/f0e8ce7123cfb38f4585.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say: Lo! As for me, my Lord hath guided me unto a straight path, a right religion, the community of Abraham, the upright, who was no idolater.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"uputiti","en":"to guide"},"passage":["قُلْ","إِنَّنِى","هَدَىٰنِى","رَبِّىٓ","إِلَىٰ","صِرَٰطٍ","مُّسْتَقِيمٍ","دِينًا","قِيَمًا","مِّلَّةَ","إِبْرَٰهِيمَ","حَنِيفًا","وَمَا","كَانَ","مِنَ","ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"هَدَى"}},{"id":"hada-7-148-17","words":["verb:hada"],"options":[{"bs":"upućuje ih","en":"he/it guides them"},{"bs":"zaista ćemo ih uputiti","en":"surely we will guide them"},{"bs":"uputi nas","en":"guide us"},{"bs":"upućuje me","en":"he/it guides me"}],"ref":"7:148","answerWord":"يَهْدِيهِمْ","answerSound":"audio/a4ae671a0728c9d04634.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And the folk of Moses, after (he left them), chose a calf (for worship), (made) out of their ornaments, of saffron hue, which gave a lowing sound. Saw they not that it spake not unto them nor guided them to any way? They chose it, and became wrong-doers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"uputiti","en":"to guide"},"passage":["وَٱتَّخَذَ","قَوْمُ","مُوسَىٰ","مِنۢ","بَعْدِهِۦ","مِنْ","حُلِيِّهِمْ","عِجْلًا","جَسَدًا","لَّهُۥ","خُوَارٌ","أَلَمْ","يَرَوْا۟","أَنَّهُۥ","لَا","يُكَلِّمُهُمْ","وَلَا","يَهْدِيهِمْ","سَبِيلًا","ٱتَّخَذُوهُ","وَكَانُوا۟","ظَٰلِمِينَ"],"marked":[17],"facts":{"verb":"هَدَى"}},{"id":"hada-22-24-0","words":["verb:hada"],"options":[{"bs":"i upućeni su","en":"and they were guided"},{"bs":"i uputili smo ih","en":"and we guided them (two)"},{"bs":"i uputi nas!","en":"and guide us!"},{"bs":"uputio nas je","en":"he/it guided us"}],"ref":"22:24","answerWord":"وَهُدُوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/5f8b21e8631a7b1752f5.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They are guided unto gentle speech; they are guided unto the path of the Glorious One.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"uputiti","en":"to guide"},"passage":["وَهُدُوٓا۟","إِلَى","ٱلطَّيِّبِ","مِنَ","ٱلْقَوْلِ","وَهُدُوٓا۟","إِلَىٰ","صِرَٰطِ","ٱلْحَمِيدِ"],"marked":[0,5],"facts":{"verb":"هَدَى"}},{"id":"hada-87-3-2","words":["verb:hada"],"options":[{"bs":"pa je uputio","en":"so he/it guided"},{"bs":"uputio ih je","en":"he/it guided them"},{"bs":"upućuje me","en":"he/it guides me"},{"bs":"upućujem te","en":"I guide you"}],"ref":"87:3","answerWord":"فَهَدَىٰ","answerSound":"audio/feda8ba1fe4c6d5bf81a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Who measureth, then guideth;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"uputiti","en":"to guide"},"passage":["وَٱلَّذِى","قَدَّرَ","فَهَدَىٰ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"هَدَى"}},{"id":"hada-1-6-0","words":["verb:hada"],"options":[{"bs":"uputi nas","en":"guide us"},{"bs":"i uputili bismo ih","en":"and We would have guided them"},{"bs":"uputili smo","en":"we guided"},{"bs":"uputio si nas","en":"you guided us"}],"ref":"1:6","answerWord":"ٱهْدِنَا","answerSound":"audio/fac85b1f91b4f3392123.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Show us the straight path,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"uputiti","en":"to guide"},"passage":["ٱهْدِنَا","ٱلصِّرَٰطَ","ٱلْمُسْتَقِيمَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"هَدَى"}},{"id":"hada-3-8-6","words":["verb:hada"],"options":[{"bs":"uputio si nas","en":"you guided us"},{"bs":"i upućeni su","en":"and they were guided"},{"bs":"pa je uputio","en":"so he/it guided"},{"bs":"pa smo ih uputili","en":"so we guided them"}],"ref":"3:8","answerWord":"هَدَيْتَنَا","answerSound":"audio/bce744d68f0a44a52a30.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Our Lord! Cause not our hearts to stray after Thou hast guided us, and bestow upon us mercy from Thy Presence. Lo! Thou, only Thou, art the Bestower.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"uputiti","en":"to guide"},"passage":["رَبَّنَا","لَا","تُزِغْ","قُلُوبَنَا","بَعْدَ","إِذْ","هَدَيْتَنَا","وَهَبْ","لَنَا","مِن","لَّدُنكَ","رَحْمَةً","إِنَّكَ","أَنتَ","ٱلْوَهَّابُ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"هَدَى"}},{"id":"hada-3-101-13","words":["verb:hada"],"options":[{"bs":"upućen je","en":"he/it was guided"},{"bs":"uputio me je","en":"he/it guided me"},{"bs":"i upućuje vas","en":"and he/it guides you (all)"},{"bs":"i upućeni su","en":"and they were guided"}],"ref":"3:101","answerWord":"هُدِىَ","answerSound":"audio/854555fb049a9699279b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"How can ye disbelieve, when it is ye unto whom Allah's revelations are recited, and His messenger is in your midst? He who holdeth fast to Allah, he indeed is guided unto a right path.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"uputiti","en":"to guide"},"passage":["وَكَيْفَ","تَكْفُرُونَ","وَأَنتُمْ","تُتْلَىٰ","عَلَيْكُمْ","ءَايَٰتُ","ٱللَّهِ","وَفِيكُمْ","رَسُولُهُۥ","وَمَن","يَعْتَصِم","بِٱللَّهِ","فَقَدْ","هُدِىَ","إِلَىٰ","صِرَٰطٍ","مُّسْتَقِيمٍ"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"هَدَى"}},{"id":"hada-4-68-0","words":["verb:hada"],"options":[{"bs":"i uputili bismo ih","en":"and We would have guided them"},{"bs":"upućuje me","en":"he/it guides me"},{"bs":"uputio je","en":"he/it guided"},{"bs":"upućuje ih","en":"he/it guides them"}],"ref":"4:68","answerWord":"وَلَهَدَيْنَٰهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/c4a6133c8abece6f2f52.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And should guide them unto a straight path.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"uputiti","en":"to guide"},"passage":["وَلَهَدَيْنَٰهُمْ","صِرَٰطًا","مُّسْتَقِيمًا"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"هَدَى"}},{"id":"hada-4-88-11","words":["verb:hada"],"options":[{"bs":"upućujete","en":"you (all) guide"},{"bs":"i upućeni su","en":"and they were guided"},{"bs":"upućen je","en":"he/it was guided"},{"bs":"pa je uputio","en":"so he/it guided"}],"ref":"4:88","answerWord":"تَهْدُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/9448e12685aadb5bdffb.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"What aileth you that ye are become two parties regarding the hypocrites, when Allah cast them back (to disbelief) because of what they earned? Seek ye to guide him whom Allah hath sent astray? He whom Allah sendeth astray, for him thou (O MUhammad) canst not find a road.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"uputiti","en":"to guide"},"passage":["فَمَا","لَكُمْ","فِى","ٱلْمُنَٰفِقِينَ","فِئَتَيْنِ","وَٱللَّهُ","أَرْكَسَهُم","بِمَا","كَسَبُوٓا۟","أَتُرِيدُونَ","أَن","تَهْدُوا۟","مَنْ","أَضَلَّ","ٱللَّهُ","وَمَن","يُضْلِلِ","ٱللَّهُ","فَلَن","تَجِدَ","لَهُۥ","سَبِيلًا"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"هَدَى"}},{"id":"mattaa-15-88-5","words":["verb:mattaa"],"options":[{"bs":"dali smo da uživa","en":"we gave enjoyment"},{"bs":"pa ih darujte!","en":"so (you all) provide for them!"},{"bs":"dao sam da uživa","en":"I gave enjoyment"},{"bs":"pa mu dajem da uživa","en":"so I let him enjoy"}],"ref":"15:88","answerWord":"مَتَّعْنَا","answerSound":"audio/1adb349070e1cadaee75.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Strain not thine eyes toward that which We cause some wedded pairs among them to enjoin, and be not grieved on their account, and lower thy wing (in tenderness) for the believers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dati da uživa, opskrbiti","en":"to let enjoy, to provide"},"passage":["لَا","تَمُدَّنَّ","عَيْنَيْكَ","إِلَىٰ","مَا","مَتَّعْنَا","بِهِۦٓ","أَزْوَٰجًا","مِّنْهُمْ","وَلَا","تَحْزَنْ","عَلَيْهِمْ","وَٱخْفِضْ","جَنَاحَكَ","لِلْمُؤْمِنِينَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"مَتَّعَ"}},{"id":"mattaa-2-126-21","words":["verb:mattaa"],"options":[{"bs":"pa mu dajem da uživa","en":"so I let him enjoy"},{"bs":"dao sam da uživa","en":"I gave enjoyment"},{"bs":"pa smo im dali da uživaju","en":"so we let them enjoy"},{"bs":"dali smo mu da uživa","en":"we let him enjoy"}],"ref":"2:126","answerWord":"فَأُمَتِّعُهُۥ","answerSound":"audio/def514974fd6ee00c03f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when Abraham prayed: My Lord! Make this a region of security and bestow upon its people fruits, such of them as believe in Allah and the Last Day, He answered: As for him who disbelieveth, I shall leave him in contentment for a while, then I shall compel him to the doom of Fire - a hapless journey's end!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dati da uživa, opskrbiti","en":"to let enjoy, to provide"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","قَالَ","إِبْرَٰهِۦمُ","رَبِّ","ٱجْعَلْ","هَٰذَا","بَلَدًا","ءَامِنًا","وَٱرْزُقْ","أَهْلَهُۥ","مِنَ","ٱلثَّمَرَٰتِ","مَنْ","ءَامَنَ","مِنْهُم","بِٱللَّهِ","وَٱلْيَوْمِ","ٱلْءَاخِرِ","قَالَ","وَمَن","كَفَرَ","فَأُمَتِّعُهُۥ","قَلِيلًا","ثُمَّ","أَضْطَرُّهُۥٓ","إِلَىٰ","عَذَابِ","ٱلنَّارِ","وَبِئْسَ","ٱلْمَصِيرُ"],"marked":[21],"facts":{"verb":"مَتَّعَ"}},{"id":"mattaa-2-236-13","words":["verb:mattaa"],"options":[{"bs":"i darujte ih!","en":"and (you all) provide for them!"},{"bs":"damo im da uživaju","en":"We let them enjoy"},{"bs":"dao sam da uživa","en":"I gave enjoyment"},{"bs":"daje vam da uživate","en":"he/it lets you (all) enjoy"}],"ref":"2:236","answerWord":"وَمَتِّعُوهُنَّ","answerSound":"audio/098f37bddc23b342595b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"It is no sin for you if ye divorce women while yet ye have not touched them, nor appointed unto them a portion. Provide for them, the rich according to his means, and the straitened according to his means, a fair provision. (This is) a bounden duty for those who do good.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dati da uživa, opskrbiti","en":"to let enjoy, to provide"},"passage":["لَّا","جُنَاحَ","عَلَيْكُمْ","إِن","طَلَّقْتُمُ","ٱلنِّسَآءَ","مَا","لَمْ","تَمَسُّوهُنَّ","أَوْ","تَفْرِضُوا۟","لَهُنَّ","فَرِيضَةً","وَمَتِّعُوهُنَّ","عَلَى","ٱلْمُوسِعِ","قَدَرُهُۥ","وَعَلَى","ٱلْمُقْتِرِ","قَدَرُهُۥ","مَتَٰعًۢا","بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ","حَقًّا","عَلَى","ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"مَتَّعَ"}},{"id":"mattaa-10-98-18","words":["verb:mattaa"],"options":[{"bs":"i dali smo im da uživaju","en":"and we let them enjoy"},{"bs":"dao sam da uživa","en":"I gave enjoyment"},{"bs":"dao si im da uživaju","en":"you let them enjoy"},{"bs":"daje vam da uživate","en":"he/it lets you (all) enjoy"}],"ref":"10:98","answerWord":"وَمَتَّعْنَٰهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/8fb4d4d7e74601e94373.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"If only there had been a community (of all those that were destroyed of old) that believed and profited by its belief as did the folk of Jonah! When they believed We drew off from them the torment of disgrace in the life of the world and gave them comfort for a while.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dati da uživa, opskrbiti","en":"to let enjoy, to provide"},"passage":["فَلَوْلَا","كَانَتْ","قَرْيَةٌ","ءَامَنَتْ","فَنَفَعَهَآ","إِيمَٰنُهَآ","إِلَّا","قَوْمَ","يُونُسَ","لَمَّآ","ءَامَنُوا۟","كَشَفْنَا","عَنْهُمْ","عَذَابَ","ٱلْخِزْىِ","فِى","ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","ٱلدُّنْيَا","وَمَتَّعْنَٰهُمْ","إِلَىٰ","حِينٍ"],"marked":[18],"facts":{"verb":"مَتَّعَ"}},{"id":"mattaa-11-3-6","words":["verb:mattaa"],"options":[{"bs":"daje vam da uživate","en":"he/it lets you (all) enjoy"},{"bs":"dao sam da uživa","en":"I gave enjoyment"},{"bs":"pa smo im dali da uživaju","en":"so we let them enjoy"},{"bs":"pa mu dajem da uživa","en":"so I let him enjoy"}],"ref":"11:3","answerWord":"يُمَتِّعْكُم","answerSound":"audio/52129cb1e47f4ec9ccb3.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And (bidding you): Ask pardon of your Lord and turn to Him repentant. He will cause you to enjoy a fair estate until a time appointed. He giveth His bounty unto every bountiful one. But if ye turn away, lo! (then) I fear for you the retribution of an awful Day.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dati da uživa, opskrbiti","en":"to let enjoy, to provide"},"passage":["وَأَنِ","ٱسْتَغْفِرُوا۟","رَبَّكُمْ","ثُمَّ","تُوبُوٓا۟","إِلَيْهِ","يُمَتِّعْكُم","مَّتَٰعًا","حَسَنًا","إِلَىٰٓ","أَجَلٍ","مُّسَمًّى","وَيُؤْتِ","كُلَّ","ذِى","فَضْلٍ","فَضْلَهُۥ","وَإِن","تَوَلَّوْا۟","فَإِنِّىٓ","أَخَافُ","عَلَيْكُمْ","عَذَابَ","يَوْمٍ","كَبِيرٍ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"مَتَّعَ"}},{"id":"mattaa-11-48-12","words":["verb:mattaa"],"options":[{"bs":"dat ćemo im da uživaju","en":"we will let them enjoy"},{"bs":"daje vam se da uživate","en":"you (all) are given enjoyment"},{"bs":"pa ih darujte!","en":"so (you all) provide for them!"},{"bs":"dali smo da uživa","en":"we gave enjoyment"}],"ref":"11:48","answerWord":"سَنُمَتِّعُهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/95d6830ee88eec154e2e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"It was said (unto him): O Noah! Go thou down (from the mountain) with peace from Us and blessings upon thee and some nations (that will spring) from those with thee. (There will be other) nations unto whom We shall give enjoyment a long while and then a painful doom from Us will overtake them.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dati da uživa, opskrbiti","en":"to let enjoy, to provide"},"passage":["قِيلَ","يَٰنُوحُ","ٱهْبِطْ","بِسَلَٰمٍ","مِّنَّا","وَبَرَكَٰتٍ","عَلَيْكَ","وَعَلَىٰٓ","أُمَمٍ","مِّمَّن","مَّعَكَ","وَأُمَمٌ","سَنُمَتِّعُهُمْ","ثُمَّ","يَمَسُّهُم","مِّنَّا","عَذَابٌ","أَلِيمٌ"],"marked":[12],"facts":{"verb":"مَتَّعَ"}},{"id":"mattaa-25-18-13","words":["verb:mattaa"],"options":[{"bs":"dao si im da uživaju","en":"you let them enjoy"},{"bs":"daje vam se da uživate","en":"you (all) are given enjoyment"},{"bs":"i darujte ih!","en":"and (you all) provide for them!"},{"bs":"damo im da uživaju","en":"We let them enjoy"}],"ref":"25:18","answerWord":"مَّتَّعْتَهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/1bb209cb615094dc90bc.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They will say: Be Thou Glorified! it was not for us to choose any protecting friends beside thee; but Thou didst give them and their fathers ease till they forgot the warning and became lost folk.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dati da uživa, opskrbiti","en":"to let enjoy, to provide"},"passage":["قَالُوا۟","سُبْحَٰنَكَ","مَا","كَانَ","يَنۢبَغِى","لَنَآ","أَن","نَّتَّخِذَ","مِن","دُونِكَ","مِنْ","أَوْلِيَآءَ","وَلَٰكِن","مَّتَّعْتَهُمْ","وَءَابَآءَهُمْ","حَتَّىٰ","نَسُوا۟","ٱلذِّكْرَ","وَكَانُوا۟","قَوْمًۢا","بُورًا"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"مَتَّعَ"}},{"id":"mattaa-26-205-2","words":["verb:mattaa"],"options":[{"bs":"damo im da uživaju","en":"We let them enjoy"},{"bs":"dat ćemo im da uživaju","en":"we will let them enjoy"},{"bs":"dao sam da uživa","en":"I gave enjoyment"},{"bs":"i darujte ih!","en":"and (you all) provide for them!"}],"ref":"26:205","answerWord":"مَّتَّعْنَٰهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/52a9114732e09d1f3ac1.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Hast thou then seen, if We content them for (long) years,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dati da uživa, opskrbiti","en":"to let enjoy, to provide"},"passage":["أَفَرَءَيْتَ","إِن","مَّتَّعْنَٰهُمْ","سِنِينَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"مَتَّعَ"}},{"id":"mattaa-26-207-5","words":["verb:mattaa"],"options":[{"bs":"daje im se da uživaju","en":"they are given enjoyment"},{"bs":"daje vam se da uživate","en":"you (all) are given enjoyment"},{"bs":"damo im da uživaju","en":"We let them enjoy"},{"bs":"dat ćemo im da uživaju","en":"we will let them enjoy"}],"ref":"26:207","answerWord":"يُمَتَّعُونَ","answerSound":"audio/4f6abd48840a022a0b14.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"(How) that wherewith they were contented naught availeth them?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dati da uživa, opskrbiti","en":"to let enjoy, to provide"},"passage":["مَآ","أَغْنَىٰ","عَنْهُم","مَّا","كَانُوا۟","يُمَتَّعُونَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"مَتَّعَ"}},{"id":"mattaa-28-61-7","words":["verb:mattaa"],"options":[{"bs":"dali smo mu da uživa","en":"we let him enjoy"},{"bs":"dajemo im da uživaju","en":"We let them enjoy"},{"bs":"daje vam se da uživate","en":"you (all) are given enjoyment"},{"bs":"i darujte ih!","en":"and (you all) provide for them!"}],"ref":"28:61","answerWord":"مَّتَّعْنَٰهُ","answerSound":"audio/2777225ef66d5e9fd750.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Is he whom We have promised a fair promise which he will find (true) like him whom We suffer to enjoy awhile the comfort of the life of the world, then on the Day of Resurrection he will be of those arraigned?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dati da uživa, opskrbiti","en":"to let enjoy, to provide"},"passage":["أَفَمَن","وَعَدْنَٰهُ","وَعْدًا","حَسَنًا","فَهُوَ","لَٰقِيهِ","كَمَن","مَّتَّعْنَٰهُ","مَتَٰعَ","ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","ٱلدُّنْيَا","ثُمَّ","هُوَ","يَوْمَ","ٱلْقِيَٰمَةِ","مِنَ","ٱلْمُحْضَرِينَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"مَتَّعَ"}},{"id":"mattaa-31-24-0","words":["verb:mattaa"],"options":[{"bs":"dajemo im da uživaju","en":"We let them enjoy"},{"bs":"dao si im da uživaju","en":"you let them enjoy"},{"bs":"daje vam se da uživate","en":"you (all) are given enjoyment"},{"bs":"i dali smo im da uživaju","en":"and we let them enjoy"}],"ref":"31:24","answerWord":"نُمَتِّعُهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/bad8265350c19298d5b5.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"We give them comfort for a little, and then We drive them to a heavy doom.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dati da uživa, opskrbiti","en":"to let enjoy, to provide"},"passage":["نُمَتِّعُهُمْ","قَلِيلًا","ثُمَّ","نَضْطَرُّهُمْ","إِلَىٰ","عَذَابٍ","غَلِيظٍ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"مَتَّعَ"}},{"id":"mattaa-33-16-12","words":["verb:mattaa"],"options":[{"bs":"daje vam se da uživate","en":"you (all) are given enjoyment"},{"bs":"pa mu dajem da uživa","en":"so I let him enjoy"},{"bs":"i darujte ih!","en":"and (you all) provide for them!"},{"bs":"dat ćemo im da uživaju","en":"we will let them enjoy"}],"ref":"33:16","answerWord":"تُمَتَّعُونَ","answerSound":"audio/439f891f364177fc1422.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say: Flight will not avail you if ye flee from death or killing, and then ye dwell in comfort but a little while.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dati da uživa, opskrbiti","en":"to let enjoy, to provide"},"passage":["قُل","لَّن","يَنفَعَكُمُ","ٱلْفِرَارُ","إِن","فَرَرْتُم","مِّنَ","ٱلْمَوْتِ","أَوِ","ٱلْقَتْلِ","وَإِذًا","لَّا","تُمَتَّعُونَ","إِلَّا","قَلِيلًا"],"marked":[12],"facts":{"verb":"مَتَّعَ"}},{"id":"mattaa-33-28-11","words":["verb:mattaa"],"options":[{"bs":"darujem vas","en":"I provide for you (all)"},{"bs":"dali smo mu da uživa","en":"we let him enjoy"},{"bs":"i darujte ih!","en":"and (you all) provide for them!"},{"bs":"dali smo da uživa","en":"we gave enjoyment"}],"ref":"33:28","answerWord":"أُمَتِّعْكُنَّ","answerSound":"audio/2aaa8626200e151fc858.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O Prophet! Say unto thy wives: If ye desire the world's life and its adornment, come! I will content you and will release you with a fair release.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dati da uživa, opskrbiti","en":"to let enjoy, to provide"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلنَّبِىُّ","قُل","لِّأَزْوَٰجِكَ","إِن","كُنتُنَّ","تُرِدْنَ","ٱلْحَيَوٰةَ","ٱلدُّنْيَا","وَزِينَتَهَا","فَتَعَالَيْنَ","أُمَتِّعْكُنَّ","وَأُسَرِّحْكُنَّ","سَرَاحًا","جَمِيلًا"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"مَتَّعَ"}},{"id":"mattaa-33-49-18","words":["verb:mattaa"],"options":[{"bs":"pa ih darujte!","en":"so (you all) provide for them!"},{"bs":"dat ćemo im da uživaju","en":"we will let them enjoy"},{"bs":"daje im se da uživaju","en":"they are given enjoyment"},{"bs":"dali smo mu da uživa","en":"we let him enjoy"}],"ref":"33:49","answerWord":"فَمَتِّعُوهُنَّ","answerSound":"audio/22083e38498e8a93eee6.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O ye who believe! If ye wed believing women and divorce them before ye have touched them, then there is no period that ye should reckon. But content them and release them handsomely.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dati da uživa, opskrbiti","en":"to let enjoy, to provide"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوٓا۟","إِذَا","نَكَحْتُمُ","ٱلْمُؤْمِنَٰتِ","ثُمَّ","طَلَّقْتُمُوهُنَّ","مِن","قَبْلِ","أَن","تَمَسُّوهُنَّ","فَمَا","لَكُمْ","عَلَيْهِنَّ","مِنْ","عِدَّةٍ","تَعْتَدُّونَهَا","فَمَتِّعُوهُنَّ","وَسَرِّحُوهُنَّ","سَرَاحًا","جَمِيلًا"],"marked":[18],"facts":{"verb":"مَتَّعَ"}},{"id":"mattaa-37-148-1","words":["verb:mattaa"],"options":[{"bs":"pa smo im dali da uživaju","en":"so we let them enjoy"},{"bs":"dali smo da uživa","en":"we gave enjoyment"},{"bs":"dao si im da uživaju","en":"you let them enjoy"},{"bs":"pa mu dajem da uživa","en":"so I let him enjoy"}],"ref":"37:148","answerWord":"فَمَتَّعْنَٰهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/118192df4ce40d9ed9d1.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And they believed, therefor We gave them comfort for a while.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dati da uživa, opskrbiti","en":"to let enjoy, to provide"},"passage":["فَـَٔامَنُوا۟","فَمَتَّعْنَٰهُمْ","إِلَىٰ","حِينٍ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"مَتَّعَ"}},{"id":"mattaa-43-29-1","words":["verb:mattaa"],"options":[{"bs":"dao sam da uživa","en":"I gave enjoyment"},{"bs":"dajemo im da uživaju","en":"We let them enjoy"},{"bs":"dali smo mu da uživa","en":"we let him enjoy"},{"bs":"pa mu dajem da uživa","en":"so I let him enjoy"}],"ref":"43:29","answerWord":"مَتَّعْتُ","answerSound":"audio/ec760b08ab2ad78bd5c9.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Nay, but I let these and their fathers enjoy life (only) till there should come unto them the Truth and a messenger making plain.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dati da uživa, opskrbiti","en":"to let enjoy, to provide"},"passage":["بَلْ","مَتَّعْتُ","هَٰٓؤُلَآءِ","وَءَابَآءَهُمْ","حَتَّىٰ","جَآءَهُمُ","ٱلْحَقُّ","وَرَسُولٌ","مُّبِينٌ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"مَتَّعَ"}},{"id":"thabbata-2-250-9","words":["verb:thabbata"],"options":[{"bs":"i učvrsti!","en":"and make firm!"},{"bs":"i učvrstit će","en":"and He will make firm"},{"bs":"učvrstili smo te","en":"We made you firm"},{"bs":"da učvrstimo","en":"so that we may make firm"}],"ref":"2:250","answerWord":"وَثَبِّتْ","answerSound":"audio/89be655315264df00ec9.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when they went into the field against Goliath and his hosts they said: Our Lord! Bestow on us endurance, make our foothold sure, and give us help against the disbelieving folk.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učvrstiti, ojačati","en":"to make firm, to strengthen"},"passage":["وَلَمَّا","بَرَزُوا۟","لِجَالُوتَ","وَجُنُودِهِۦ","قَالُوا۟","رَبَّنَآ","أَفْرِغْ","عَلَيْنَا","صَبْرًا","وَثَبِّتْ","أَقْدَامَنَا","وَٱنصُرْنَا","عَلَى","ٱلْقَوْمِ","ٱلْكَٰفِرِينَ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"ثَبَّتَ"}},{"id":"thabbata-8-11-19","words":["verb:thabbata"],"options":[{"bs":"i učvršćuje","en":"and he/it makes firm"},{"bs":"da učvrstimo","en":"so that we may make firm"},{"bs":"učvrstili smo te","en":"We made you firm"},{"bs":"i učvrsti!","en":"and make firm!"}],"ref":"8:11","answerWord":"وَيُثَبِّتَ","answerSound":"audio/c2d5e7aa39938742c6a6.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"When He made the slumber fall upon you as a reassurance from him and sent down water from the sky upon you, that thereby He might purify you, and remove from you the fear of Satan, and make strong your hearts and firm (your) feet thereby.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učvrstiti, ojačati","en":"to make firm, to strengthen"},"passage":["إِذْ","يُغَشِّيكُمُ","ٱلنُّعَاسَ","أَمَنَةً","مِّنْهُ","وَيُنَزِّلُ","عَلَيْكُم","مِّنَ","ٱلسَّمَآءِ","مَآءً","لِّيُطَهِّرَكُم","بِهِۦ","وَيُذْهِبَ","عَنكُمْ","رِجْزَ","ٱلشَّيْطَٰنِ","وَلِيَرْبِطَ","عَلَىٰ","قُلُوبِكُمْ","وَيُثَبِّتَ","بِهِ","ٱلْأَقْدَامَ"],"marked":[19],"facts":{"verb":"ثَبَّتَ"}},{"id":"thabbata-8-12-7","words":["verb:thabbata"],"options":[{"bs":"pa učvrstite!","en":"so (you all) make firm!"},{"bs":"i učvršćuje","en":"and he/it makes firm"},{"bs":"i učvrsti!","en":"and make firm!"},{"bs":"da učvrstimo","en":"so that we may make firm"}],"ref":"8:12","answerWord":"فَثَبِّتُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/54c51c63906419962c00.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"When thy Lord inspired the angels, (saying): I am with you. So make those who believe stand firm. I will throw fear into the hearts of those who disbelieve. Then smite the necks and smite of them each finger.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učvrstiti, ojačati","en":"to make firm, to strengthen"},"passage":["إِذْ","يُوحِى","رَبُّكَ","إِلَى","ٱلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةِ","أَنِّى","مَعَكُمْ","فَثَبِّتُوا۟","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","سَأُلْقِى","فِى","قُلُوبِ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","ٱلرُّعْبَ","فَٱضْرِبُوا۟","فَوْقَ","ٱلْأَعْنَاقِ","وَٱضْرِبُوا۟","مِنْهُمْ","كُلَّ","بَنَانٍ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"ثَبَّتَ"}},{"id":"thabbata-11-120-7","words":["verb:thabbata"],"options":[{"bs":"učvršćujemo","en":"we make firm"},{"bs":"i učvršćuje","en":"and he/it makes firm"},{"bs":"i učvrsti!","en":"and make firm!"},{"bs":"učvrstili smo te","en":"We made you firm"}],"ref":"11:120","answerWord":"نُثَبِّتُ","answerSound":"audio/8edfb35ad96ca5293c1b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And all that We relate unto thee of the story of the messengers is in order that thereby We may make firm thy heart. And herein hath come unto thee the Truth and an exhortation and a reminder for believers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učvrstiti, ojačati","en":"to make firm, to strengthen"},"passage":["وَكُلًّا","نَّقُصُّ","عَلَيْكَ","مِنْ","أَنۢبَآءِ","ٱلرُّسُلِ","مَا","نُثَبِّتُ","بِهِۦ","فُؤَادَكَ","وَجَآءَكَ","فِى","هَٰذِهِ","ٱلْحَقُّ","وَمَوْعِظَةٌ","وَذِكْرَىٰ","لِلْمُؤْمِنِينَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"ثَبَّتَ"}},{"id":"thabbata-14-27-0","words":["verb:thabbata"],"options":[{"bs":"učvršćuje","en":"he/it makes firm"},{"bs":"učvršćujemo","en":"we make firm"},{"bs":"i učvrsti!","en":"and make firm!"},{"bs":"učvrstili smo te","en":"We made you firm"}],"ref":"14:27","answerWord":"يُثَبِّتُ","answerSound":"audio/a5c6bc8ca7701fe47a6a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Allah confirmeth those who believe by a firm saying in the life of the world and in the Hereafter, and Allah sendeth wrong-doers astray. And Allah doeth what He will.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učvrstiti, ojačati","en":"to make firm, to strengthen"},"passage":["يُثَبِّتُ","ٱللَّهُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","بِٱلْقَوْلِ","ٱلثَّابِتِ","فِى","ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","ٱلدُّنْيَا","وَفِى","ٱلْءَاخِرَةِ","وَيُضِلُّ","ٱللَّهُ","ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ","وَيَفْعَلُ","ٱللَّهُ","مَا","يَشَآءُ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"ثَبَّتَ"}},{"id":"thabbata-16-102-7","words":["verb:thabbata"],"options":[{"bs":"da učvrsti","en":"so that he/it may make firm"},{"bs":"da učvrstimo","en":"so that we may make firm"},{"bs":"pa učvrstite!","en":"so (you all) make firm!"},{"bs":"učvrstili smo te","en":"We made you firm"}],"ref":"16:102","answerWord":"لِيُثَبِّتَ","answerSound":"audio/29b2f24b1cc898cb66e8.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say: The holy Spirit hath delivered it from thy Lord with truth, that it may confirm (the faith of) those who believe, and as guidance and good tidings for those who have surrendered (to Allah).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učvrstiti, ojačati","en":"to make firm, to strengthen"},"passage":["قُلْ","نَزَّلَهُۥ","رُوحُ","ٱلْقُدُسِ","مِن","رَّبِّكَ","بِٱلْحَقِّ","لِيُثَبِّتَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","وَهُدًى","وَبُشْرَىٰ","لِلْمُسْلِمِينَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"ثَبَّتَ"}},{"id":"thabbata-17-74-2","words":["verb:thabbata"],"options":[{"bs":"učvrstili smo te","en":"We made you firm"},{"bs":"da učvrsti","en":"so that he/it may make firm"},{"bs":"pa učvrstite!","en":"so (you all) make firm!"},{"bs":"i učvrsti!","en":"and make firm!"}],"ref":"17:74","answerWord":"ثَبَّتْنَٰكَ","answerSound":"audio/3c07d5c3708d371579fd.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And if We had not made thee wholly firm thou mightest almost have inclined unto them a little.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učvrstiti, ojačati","en":"to make firm, to strengthen"},"passage":["وَلَوْلَآ","أَن","ثَبَّتْنَٰكَ","لَقَدْ","كِدتَّ","تَرْكَنُ","إِلَيْهِمْ","شَيْـًٔا","قَلِيلًا"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"ثَبَّتَ"}},{"id":"thabbata-25-32-10","words":["verb:thabbata"],"options":[{"bs":"da učvrstimo","en":"so that we may make firm"},{"bs":"učvršćuje","en":"he/it makes firm"},{"bs":"pa učvrstite!","en":"so (you all) make firm!"},{"bs":"i učvrsti!","en":"and make firm!"}],"ref":"25:32","answerWord":"لِنُثَبِّتَ","answerSound":"audio/cfe035566644a3890b3e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And those who disbelieve say: Why is the Qur'an not revealed unto him all at once? (It is revealed) thus that We may strengthen thy heart therewith; and We have arranged it in right order.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učvrstiti, ojačati","en":"to make firm, to strengthen"},"passage":["وَقَالَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","لَوْلَا","نُزِّلَ","عَلَيْهِ","ٱلْقُرْءَانُ","جُمْلَةً","وَٰحِدَةً","كَذَٰلِكَ","لِنُثَبِّتَ","بِهِۦ","فُؤَادَكَ","وَرَتَّلْنَٰهُ","تَرْتِيلًا"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"ثَبَّتَ"}},{"id":"thabbata-47-7-7","words":["verb:thabbata"],"options":[{"bs":"i učvrstit će","en":"and He will make firm"},{"bs":"i učvrsti!","en":"and make firm!"},{"bs":"da učvrstimo","en":"so that we may make firm"},{"bs":"učvrstili smo te","en":"We made you firm"}],"ref":"47:7","answerWord":"وَيُثَبِّتْ","answerSound":"audio/54390877fec1844f063f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O ye who believe! If ye help Allah, He will help you and will make your foothold firm.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učvrstiti, ojačati","en":"to make firm, to strengthen"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوٓا۟","إِن","تَنصُرُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","يَنصُرْكُمْ","وَيُثَبِّتْ","أَقْدَامَكُمْ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"ثَبَّتَ"}},{"id":"tallaqa-2-230-1","words":["verb:tallaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"razveo se od nje","en":"he/it divorced her"},{"bs":"razveo se od vas","en":"he/it divorced you (all)"},{"bs":"razveli ste se od njih","en":"you (all) divorced them"},{"bs":"razveli ste se","en":"you (all) divorced"}],"ref":"2:230","answerWord":"طَلَّقَهَا","answerSound":"audio/24fbbf2c8a6f71fc86a5.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And if he hath divorced her (the third time), then she is not lawful unto him thereafter until she hath wedded another husband. Then if he (the other husband) divorce her it is no sin for both of them that they come together again if they consider that they are able to observe the limits of Allah. These are the limits of Allah. He manifesteth them for people who have knowledge.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"razvesti se","en":"to divorce"},"passage":["فَإِن","طَلَّقَهَا","فَلَا","تَحِلُّ","لَهُۥ","مِنۢ","بَعْدُ","حَتَّىٰ","تَنكِحَ","زَوْجًا","غَيْرَهُۥ","فَإِن","طَلَّقَهَا","فَلَا","جُنَاحَ","عَلَيْهِمَآ","أَن","يَتَرَاجَعَآ","إِن","ظَنَّآ","أَن","يُقِيمَا","حُدُودَ","ٱللَّهِ","وَتِلْكَ","حُدُودُ","ٱللَّهِ","يُبَيِّنُهَا","لِقَوْمٍ","يَعْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[1,12],"facts":{"verb":"طَلَّقَ"}},{"id":"tallaqa-66-5-3","words":["verb:tallaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"razveo se od vas","en":"he/it divorced you (all)"},{"bs":"pa se razvedite od njih!","en":"so (you all) divorce them!"},{"bs":"razveo se od nje","en":"he/it divorced her"},{"bs":"razveli ste se od njih","en":"you (all) divorced them"}],"ref":"66:5","answerWord":"طَلَّقَكُنَّ","answerSound":"audio/6624b9f9c46f8cee90e2.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"It may happen that his Lord, if he divorce you, will give him in your stead wives better than you, submissive (to Allah), believing, pious, penitent, devout, inclined to fasting, widows and maids.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"razvesti se","en":"to divorce"},"passage":["عَسَىٰ","رَبُّهُۥٓ","إِن","طَلَّقَكُنَّ","أَن","يُبْدِلَهُۥٓ","أَزْوَٰجًا","خَيْرًا","مِّنكُنَّ","مُسْلِمَٰتٍ","مُّؤْمِنَٰتٍ","قَٰنِتَٰتٍ","تَٰٓئِبَٰتٍ","عَٰبِدَٰتٍ","سَٰٓئِحَٰتٍ","ثَيِّبَٰتٍ","وَأَبْكَارًا"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"طَلَّقَ"}}]